mpd2mpris (0.13.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New MPRIS TrackList interface exposing the MPD queue: queue changes
    are diffed into TrackAdded/TrackRemoved signals (or one
    TrackListReplaced), with AddTrack/RemoveTrack/GoTo wired to MPD and
    gated on the server's queue-edit capability.
  * New MPRIS Playlists interface exposing MPD stored playlists;
    ActivePlaylist follows the queue's last loaded playlist (MPD >= 0.24).
  * Root interface now advertises SupportedUriSchemes (from MPD's
    urlhandlers, plus file when a music_dir is configured) and
    SupportedMimeTypes (from MPD's decoders) instead of empty lists.

 -- Mathieu Réquillart <mathieu.requillart@gmail.com>  Wed, 22 Jul 2026 18:23:33 +0000

mpd2mpris (0.12.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rename project mpDris2 -> mpd2mpris (in agreement with the original
    maintainer) to avoid confusion with eonpatapon/mpDris2.
  * Source and binary package renamed mpdris2 -> mpd2mpris; the binary,
    systemd unit and config dir follow (Conflicts/Replaces/Provides:
    mpdris2 for a clean upgrade). The MPRIS bus name
    org.mpris.MediaPlayer2.mpd is unchanged.
  * Drop Suggests: python3-systemd (unused since the asyncio rewrite).

 -- Mathieu Réquillart <mathieu.requillart@gmail.com>  Thu, 18 Jun 2026 13:00:00 +0000

